<section class="page-hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Move-out cleaning · Calgary</p><h1>Leave with a<br>clearer checklist.</h1><p class="lede">Moving already comes with enough decisions. Plan the cleaning around an empty property, your handover date and a written scope everyone can follow.</p></section><section class="section wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">For tenants, owners & property managers</p><h2>Ready for the<br>next person.</h2><p>Move-out cleaning can include more interior detail than a maintenance visit. Tell us when belongings will be removed and when keys need to be returned.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/book/">Book your clean</a></div></div><div><ul class="check-list"><li>Appliance interiors, if agreed and accessible</li><li>Empty cabinet and drawer interiors</li><li>Bathroom and kitchen detail</li><li>Baseboards and accessible trim</li><li>Floors and the priorities in your quote</li></ul></div></section><section class="soft"><div class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">Before handover</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Know the dates.</h3><p>Share your move-out date and key handover deadline. Dates remain requests until cleaner coverage is confirmed.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Know the scope.</h3><p>Flag appliance condition, wall marks, heavy buildup, pets and any property-manager checklist.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Keep a record.</h3><p>Discuss whether completion notes or photos are needed and who may receive them. Photos are shared only as agreed.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section wrap prose"><h2>How much does move-out cleaning cost in Calgary?</h2><p>Your quote depends on size, bathrooms, condition, appliance interiors and the work needed before handover. An empty condo and a large furnished house are different jobs. Request a written quote for your property rather than relying on a generic bedroom-only total.</p><div class="note">A cleaning service cannot guarantee a deposit return or determine a tenancy dispute. The agreed scope and any completion record describe the work, not a legal outcome.</div><h3>Specialist work needs a separate conversation.</h3><p>Carpet extraction, heavy junk removal, biohazards, pest contamination and remediation are not assumed to be part of a move-out clean. Tell us before requesting a date.</p></section><section class="closing wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your next step</p><h2>Plan the clean before key handover.</h2><p>Tell us about your space. We’ll review the scope, timing and cleaner availability before confirming your appointment.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/book/">Book your clean</a></section>
